WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.240
Movie

00:01.240 --> 00:06.980
The immune system explained. Have you ever wondered how your body fights off diseases and infections?

00:07.500 --> 00:09.500
It's a marvel of nature really

00:09.880 --> 00:14.540
Think of it like a fortress, but not just any fortress an intricate defense mechanism

00:14.900 --> 00:20.660
This fortress is your immune system an astonishingly complex network of cells and proteins

00:21.220 --> 00:26.060
It tirelessly protects you from microscopic threats keeping you healthy and functioning

00:26.780 --> 00:34.300
It's a ceaseless battle against invaders a war fought on the microscopic front the immune system our body's unsung hero ever

00:34.380 --> 00:41.420
Vigilant ever working your immune system is a complex network of cells and proteins that defends the body against infection

00:41.940 --> 00:48.160
It's like a well-organized army with two primary divisions each playing a crucial role in our body's defense

00:48.860 --> 00:53.300
The first is the innate immunity our body's first line of defense

00:53.860 --> 00:57.140
It's always on guard ready to attack any foreign invader

00:57.780 --> 01:03.980
It doesn't discriminate whether it's a common cold or a more serious threat it jumps into action immediately

01:03.980 --> 01:07.700
But what if the invader is too strong or too smart for our innate immunity?

01:08.140 --> 01:12.180
That's where our second division the adaptive immunity comes into play

01:13.420 --> 01:18.580
This is the immune system's memory it learns from every attack and remembers the invaders

01:18.980 --> 01:24.940
So when the same invader tries to attack again our adaptive immunity is ready with a tailored defense plan

01:25.100 --> 01:27.100
Making it harder for the invader to succeed

01:28.060 --> 01:32.220
Innate and adaptive immunity a two-fold defense designed to keep us healthy

01:33.300 --> 01:37.820
Imagine a foreign invader like a virus enters your body. What happens next?

01:39.500 --> 01:46.540
Picture an unseen battlefield within your body the first line of defense your innate immune system immediately springs into action

01:46.540 --> 01:50.540
It recognizes the invader sounding the alarm and rallying the troops

01:51.460 --> 01:58.340
Next up the adaptive immune system steps into the fray. It's more precise targeting the invader with a specific response

01:58.660 --> 02:05.460
It's like a sniper taking out the enemy with pinpoint accuracy once the invader is defeated memory cells are created

02:05.660 --> 02:11.000
These are the veterans of the immune war they remember the foe ready to fight should they dare to return

02:11.780 --> 02:15.200
The drama of this battle rages on every second of every day

02:15.800 --> 02:19.160
Every day your immune system is fighting battles. You're not even aware of

02:20.480 --> 02:27.000
From fending off common colds to battling life-threatening diseases. The immune system is our personal health guardian

02:27.000 --> 02:31.480
It tirelessly patrols our body neutralizing threats to keep us healthy

02:32.280 --> 02:34.880
Its pivotal role cannot be overstated

02:35.400 --> 02:41.280
Next time you recover from an illness. Thank your immune system your body's most sophisticated defense mechanism

